Perfect! I can see all 3 `.way-inn-in2` elements are in the "Boldteq Way" section (the right/second column). Now let me compile all the findings into a comprehensive report.

Based on my thorough read-only investigation, here is the complete structured report:

---

## IMAGE ASPECT-RATIO INVESTIGATION REPORT

### Q1: ACTUAL PIXEL DIMENSIONS OF IMAGE FILES ON DISK

**How It Works Section (Rectangle images):**
- `Rectangle-243.png`: **1492×1724 pixels**
- `Rectangle-244.png`: **1492×1724 pixels**
- `Rectangle-186.png`: **1492×1724 pixels**

All three share the same aspect ratio: **1492÷1724 = 0.865** (86.5% width-to-height)

**Benefits Grid Section (Group images):**
- `Group-47184-3.png`: **1412×1316 pixels** (1.073:1 ratio)
- `Group-47199-2.png`: **1412×1316 pixels** (1.073:1 ratio)
- `Group-47200-1.png`: **1476×1308 pixels** (1.129:1 ratio)
- `Group-47204-1.png`: **1412×1320 pixels** (1.070:1 ratio)
- `Group-47207.png`: **1412×1320 pixels** (1.070:1 ratio)
- `69a01b9f560c30b6ad5db136_Group-47208.png`: **1412×1320 pixels** (1.070:1 ratio)

**Portfolio Carousel Section:**
- `69662a202a4c0d57bdf2c10b_Home.png`: **843×951 pixels** (0.886:1 ratio)
- `Travel.png`: **840×951 pixels** (0.884:1 ratio)
- `Home-1.png`: **840×951 pixels** (0.884:1 ratio)
- `Group-7.png`: **807×856 pixels** (0.943:1 ratio)

---

### Q2: WEBFLOW HTML MARKUP FOR IMAGE TAGS

**How It Works Section (Rectangle images):**

All three share identical structure:
```
<img src="images/Rectangle-243.png" 
     loading="lazy" 
     width="1492" 
     sizes="(max-width: 1492px) 100vw, 1492px" 
     alt="[descriptive text]" 
     srcset="images/Rectangle-243-p-500.png 500w, images/Rectangle-243-p-800.png 800w, images/Rectangle-243-p-1080.png 1080w, images/Rectangle-243.png 1492w" 
     class="full-width-image">
```

**NO `height` attribute specified** (Note: Rectangle-243 line 663 shows `height="Auto"` - **DATA ANOMALY**)

Parent element structure:
- Parent: `<a href="#" class="feature-card space-between blue w-inline-block">`
- Container: `<div class="w-layout-grid feature-grid margin-top-40px">`

**Benefits Grid Section (Group images):**

`Group-47184-3.png`:
```
<img src="images/Group-47184-3.png" 
     loading="lazy" 
     width="1412" 
     height="Auto" 
     alt="[text]" 
     srcset="images/Group-47184-1-p-500.png 500w, images/Group-47184-1-p-800.png 800w, images/Group-47184-1-p-1080.png 1080w, images/Group-47184-3.png 1412w" 
     sizes="(max-width: 1412px) 100vw, 1412px" 
     class="full-width-image drop-shadow blue-shadow">
```

Other Group images: **NO `height` attribute** (or `height="Auto"`), identical `width` attribute matching disk image width (1412 or 1476)

Parent: `<a href="#" class="feature-card space-between w-inline-block">`
Container: `<div class="w-layout-grid feature-grid margin-top-40px hiring-slider">`

**Portfolio Carousel Section:**

`69662a202a4c0d57bdf2c10b_Home.png`:
```
<img width="843" 
     sizes="(max-width: 843px) 100vw, 843px" 
     alt="Portfolio Image" 
     src="images/69662a202a4c0d57bdf2c10b_Home.png" 
     loading="lazy" 
     srcset="images/69662a202a4c0d57bdf2c10b_Home-p-500.png 500w, images/69662a202a4c0d57bdf2c10b_Home-p-800.png 800w, images/69662a202a4c0d57bdf2c10b_Home.png 843w" 
     class="image-cover radius-0">
```

`Travel.png`: `width="840"`, `sizes="(max-width: 840px) 100vw, 840px"`
`Home-1.png`: `width="843"`, `sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, 843px"` (**NOTE: 991px in sizes**)
`Group-7.png`: `width="807"`, `sizes="(max-width: 807px) 100vw, 807px"`

**NO `height` attributes on any portfolio images.**

Parent structure:
```
<div class="gallery-13-card [color]">
  <div class="gallery-image-outer [color-modifier]">
    <img ... class="image-cover radius-0">
  </div>
</div>
```

---

### Q3: CSS RULES GOVERNING THESE IMAGES

**`.full-width-image` (How It Works & Benefits Grid):**

Base styles (line 2425):
```css
.full-width-image {
  grid-column-gap: 12px;
  grid-row-gap: 12px;
  grid-template-rows: auto;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
  display: block;
}
```

Main definition (line 13651):
```css
.full-width-image {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 3768px;
}

.full-width-image.drop-shadow {
  max-width: 1492px;
}

.full-width-image.drop-shadow.hide {
  display: none;
}
```

**NO `height`, `min-height`, `aspect-ratio`, or `max-height` defined on `.full-width-image`**

Media query at max-width (line 22356):
```css
.full-width-image {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 100%;
}
```

**`.feature-card.space-between` (How It Works container):**

Base styles (line 1705):
```css
.feature-card.space-between {
  background-color: #def4ff;
  justify-content: space-between;
}

.feature-card.space-between.blue {
  background-color: #1c3861;
  background-image: none;
  border-color: #ffffff1c;
}
```

**NO height constraints on container.**

Media queries (line 21927):
```css
.feature-card.space-between {
  padding-left: 20px;
  padding-right: 20px;
}
```

**NO height constraints added at any breakpoint.**

---

**`.image-cover` (Portfolio carousel):**

Base styles (line 1324):
```css
.image-cover {
  object-fit: cover;
  object-position: 50% 0%;
  border-radius: 10px;
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  min-height: auto;
  max-height: 357px;
  display: block;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.image-cover.radius-0 {
  border-radius: 0;
}

.image-cover.radius-0.opacity-0 {
  opacity: 0;
}
```

**KEY FINDING: `.image-cover` has `max-height: 357px`** — this is a hard cap on portfolio image height.

---

**`.gallery-13-card` (Portfolio carousel container):**

Base styles (line 1456):
```css
.gallery-13-card {
  aspect-ratio: 1 / 1.25;
  border: 1px #000;
  border-radius: 20px;
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 392px;
  padding: 10px;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}
```

Variants with height overrides:
```css
.gallery-13-card.orange {
  /* ... */
  height: 100%;
  min-height: 392px;
  /* ... */
}

.gallery-13-card.pink {
  /* ... */
  height: 100%;
}

.gallery-13-card.yellow {
  aspect-ratio: auto;
  /* ... */
  height: 100%;
  min-height: auto;
  /* ... */
}
```

**KEY FINDING: `.gallery-13-card` has `aspect-ratio: 1 / 1.25` with `min-height: 392px`. Color variants override with `height: 100%`.**

---

**`.gallery-image-outer` (Portfolio image wrapper):**

Base styles (line 17099):
```css
.gallery-image-outer {
  border-radius: 15px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
  padding-top: 20px;
  padding-left: 20px;
  padding-right: 20px;
}

.gallery-image-outer.green {
  background-color: #0d4a4c;
  min-height: auto;
}

.gallery-image-outer.green-light {
  background-color: #abf330;
  height: auto;
  min-height: auto;
}

/* Similar patterns for all color classes — all set min-height: auto or height: auto */
```

**NO max-height constraints on `.gallery-image-outer`.**

---

### Q4: COMPARISON — BENEFITS GRID + PORTFOLIO CAROUSEL

**Pixel dimensions summary:**
- Benefits grid images are larger (1412–1476px wide, 1308–1320px tall)
- Portfolio images are smaller (807–843px wide, 856–951px tall)
- Benefits grid aspect ratios are more square-like (~1.07:1)
- Portfolio aspect ratios are more portrait-like (~0.88:1)

**CSS constraint comparison:**
| Section | Image Class | Height Control | Aspect Ratio | Max-Height |
|---------|-------------|------------------|--------------|-----------|
| Benefits Grid | `.full-width-image` | None | None | None |
| Portfolio | `.image-cover` | `height: auto` | None | **357px** |
| Portfolio Container | `.gallery-13-card` | Varies by color | **1/1.25** | None |

**KEY ISSUE: Portfolio images are constrained by `.image-cover max-height: 357px`, Benefits Grid images are unconstrained.**

---

### Q5: PRICING CARDS MOBILE CSS

**`.pricing-card-2` base styles (line 11560):**
```css
.pricing-card-2 {
  grid-column-gap: 15px;
  grid-row-gap: 15px;
  background-color: #effafe;
  border: 1px solid #21cfff36;
  border-radius: 8px;
  flex-flow: column;
  margin-top: 40px;
  padding: 10px 10px 15px;
  display: flex;
}
```

**Mobile media query (@media max-width: 479px, line 30511):**
```css
.pricing-card-2, .pricing-card-2.white-card {
  margin-top: 0;
}
```

**Data gathered:**
- Base `padding`: `10px 10px 15px` (top/right/bottom/left = 10px, 10px, 15px, 10px)
- Base `margin-top`: `40px`
- **NO `min-height` defined on base or mobile.**
- **NO `border` values changed at mobile.**
- Mobile only changes: `margin-top: 0`
- Color variant `.white-card`: `margin-top: 42px` (base), `0` (mobile)

---

### Q6: COMPARISON MESSAGE CARDS (`.way-inn-in2`)

**CSS definition (line 17397):**
```css
.way-inn-in2 {
  grid-column-gap: 10px;
  grid-row-gap: 10px;
  background-color: #0000;
  border-radius: 0;
  justify-content: flex-start;
  align-items: flex-start;
  max-width: 372px;
  padding: 0;
  display: flex;
}

.way-inn-in2.drop-shadow.margin-top {
  margin-top: 40px;
}

.way-inn-in2.two {
  flex-flow: row-reverse;
  align-self: flex-end;
}
```

**NO min-width 1280px breakpoint rules found for `.way-inn-in2`.**

Base properties:
- `padding`: `0`
- `max-width`: `372px`
- **NO `min-height` defined**

Variant `.two`:
- `flex-flow: row-reverse` (reverses image/text order)
- `align-self: flex-end` (aligns to bottom)

---

**HTML count in Boldteq Way section:**

Total `.way-inn-in2` elements in right column (within `div class="skycolor-bg"`):
1. Line 1592: `<div class="way-inn-in2">` (client message, left-aligned image)
2. Line 1597: `<div class="way-inn-in2 two">` (Boldteq response, right-aligned icon)
3. Line 1602: `<div class="way-inn-in2">` (client message, left-aligned image)

**EXACT COUNT: 3 `.way-inn-in2` elements in the Boldteq Way section.**

All are direct children of `<div class="w-layout-grid way-inner-grid-col2">`.

---

## GROUND TRUTH SUMMARY

| Question | Finding |
|----------|---------|
| Q1 Dimensions | All confirmed via `sips` — Rectangle images 1492×1724px; Group images 1412–1476 wide; Portfolio 807–843 wide |
| Q2 HTML width attrs | Webflow specifies `width="[actual-disk-width]"` on all images; **NO height attributes** (or "Auto"); srcset/sizes present |
| Q3 CSS constraints | `.full-width-image` (How It Works) = **unconstrained**; `.image-cover` (Portfolio) = **max-height: 357px**; `.gallery-13-card` = **aspect-ratio: 1/1.25** |
| Q4 Comparison | Benefits grid lacks height controls; Portfolio hardcoded to 357px max; Gallery card has aspect ratio lock |
